 # Install
 
-Download the tarball for your platform from the releases page:
-
-```sh
-wget https://demo.dev/releases/demo-linux-x86_64.tar.gz
-tar xzf demo-linux-x86_64.tar.gz
-sudo mv demo /usr/local/bin/
-```
+One line, on Linux and macOS:
+
+```sh
+curl -fsSL https://demo.dev/install | sh
+```
 
-Then check it runs:
+It downloads the binary for your machine into `~/.local/bin` and checks
+its checksum. Then:
 
 ```sh
 demo --version
 ```
 
-## Checksums
+## By hand
 
-The checksums are next to each tarball.
+Download the binary from the [releases page](https://demo.dev/releases) and
+put it on your PATH.
+
+## Checksums
+
+All of them: [sha256.txt](https://demo.dev/releases/sha256.txt).
